{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"千雪、やったな……！","trans":"千雪，你做到了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ははっ、落ち着いてる\r\n────堂々としたステージだったもんな","trans":"哈哈，你很镇定\n————毕竟舞台表现很从容","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003020030","name":"千雪","text":"ふふ、そんな……","trans":"呵呵，哪有……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003020040","name":"千雪","text":"こっちは勝ちました\r\n────でも","trans":"这边是赢了\n————但是","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6016003020050","name":"千雪","text":"勝負はこれからなんです","trans":"胜负现在才要开始","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"プロデューサー","text":"…………\r\n千雪──────？","trans":"…………\n千雪——————？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}